      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(dispatch-wrapper): fix flock separator and script command detection",
        "body": "Related: #98964\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n1. **flock**: `flock /tmp/lock -- echo hello` not unwrapped (-- treated as option-like)\n2. **script**: `script -- echo hello` mislabeled echo as transcript file\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n- flock: skip past `--` separator to the real command\n- script: detect `--` form vs transcript-file form; transcript-only stays blocked\n\n## User Impact\nFixes command execution analysis for flock/script with `--` separator.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-all-6-proof.png)\n\n- Runtime: `flock /tmp/lock -- echo hello → unwrapped (args: echo hello)`\n- Runtime: `script -q /dev/null → blocked` (transcript-only preserved)\n- `exec-wrapper-resolution.test.ts`: 132/132 ✅ · `exec-approvals`: 48/48 ✅",
        "branch": "fix/flock-dashdash-separator",
